            "repere": "Paragraphe · I've been a \"beauty girl\" since I was …",
            "text": "I've been a \"beauty girl\" since I was 19. I've tried, gifted, reviewed, and silently rejected more skincare than most humans see in a lifetime. So when I tell you something works on a teenager please know I’m not saying it lightly!",
