            "repere": "Paragraphe · Norse Organics is what you leave on th…",
            "text": "Norse Organics is what you leave on the counter. Arctic botanicals. Real ingredients that actually heal acne instead of just drying everything out. Clean, raw, bursting with antioxidants from the freezing North. It works. They won't tell you it works. But it works.",
