            "slot": "s1505",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Norse is such a breath of fresh air. I…",
            "text": "Norse is such a breath of fresh air. It’s made from sea buckthorn, wild marigold, thistle oil, borage, mixed with beeswax. My son puts a little on at night and walks away. That's the routine. That's all of it. He's been doing it for months, which in teenage boy terms is basically a marriage.",
