            "repere": "Paragraphe · I've raised more than one kid through …",
            "text": "I've raised more than one kid through teenage acne, and I only wish I'd figured this out sooner. Clean Arctic botanicals, a short routine my kids actually stick to, and skin that finally calmed down. If you're nervous about the prescription route, try this first. It works for us.",
