            "repere": "Paragraphe · Norse Organics is the gentle option I …",
            "text": "Norse Organics is the gentle option I trust. Arctic botanicals like sea buckthorn and marigold, thistle oil and squalane, in a waterless beeswax base. It calms the redness, protects the barrier, and lets teenage skin rebalance on its own.",
